Original commit body from efb0c1b:

Two UX improvements:

1. Output summary now distinguishes cached vs generated artifacts:
   - Shows "Generated N, Using M cached" instead of "Generated N artifact(s)"
   - Lists cached files with [cached] prefix for clarity
   - Helps users understand when results are being reused

2. File content blocks now have clearer visual delineation:
   - Changed from "### filename.py" headers
   - To "------------------- START of filename.py ----" markers
   - Added matching END markers after each file
   - Makes file boundaries much easier to parse visually

Both changes improve the experience when working with cached results
and when reading file content in sketches.
